### ============ BUYER ENDPOINTS ============

### 1. Place a bid on a vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 45000,
  "message": "I'm very interested in this vehicle, can we negotiate?"
}

###

### 2. Place a bid fără mesaj
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000
}

###

### 3. Get my bids
GET {{baseUrl}}/bids/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get my bids cu paginare
GET {{baseUrl}}/bids/my?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Withdraw bid (retrage oferta)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bids/1/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ============ SELLER ENDPOINTS ============

### 6. Get all bids on my vehicle
GET {{baseUrl}}/bids/vehicle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Accept a bid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bids/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Reject a bid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bids/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Sorry, I found a buyer locally"
}

###

### 9. Reject fără motiv
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bids/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ============ ERROR CASES ============

### 10. Bid pe vehicul inexistent (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}

###

### 11. Bid pe propriul vehicul (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}

###

### 12. Bid cu suma negativa (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bids/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -500
}

###

### 13. Fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bids/my

###